          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayaye, obwiyinikhu bwobuyinda bwobuchesi nende obumanyi bwaNyasaye nobwamakana! Obukhalachibwe shibunyoolekha kata tsinjilatsie okhumanyikha tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba niwina owamanya amayililisio kOmwami? Niwina owali omuchesiyiiwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata niwina owaranjilila okhumuheelesia eshindu, mbu arungwe khandi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba amakhuwa kosi karula khuye, nikeetsa khululwe, nikachooma khuye. Ye aheebwe oluyali obushia nobushia. Amina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.36"
            ]
          }
